--------------------------------------------------------------------------

This repository references external security tools through declarative adapter
packs under tools/packs/ and git submodules under sources/. Those tools are NOT
redistributed here except where a pack explicitly stages a digest-pinned
artifact; each remains under its own upstream licence, and pack metadata records
the licence for every staged artifact. Consult the upstream project before
redistributing any of them.
